  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "DHCPv6: Add address-registration (RFC9686)",
  "description": "There's RFC9686 recently published that adds an address registration mechanism in DHCPv6. It adds two new DHCPv6 messages (ADDR-REG-INFORM, ADDR-REG-REPLY), and one new DHCPv6 option (ADDR-REG-ENABLE). This is effectively what this small patch does.\n\nI did one minor unrelated change: When updating list of supported RFCs I added an RFC9463 which was added in earlier PR (!16781). Hope that's OK.",
