        {
          "id": 2399507071,
          "type": "DiffNote",
          "body": "This MR was already merged. Should I open new MR for this? \n\nAlso, there's a bunch of other clean-ups and easy things could be done:\n\n- add remaining message types (22-35)\n- update option references to be in line with IANA (RFC8415 was published couple years ago that aggregated many older RFCs)\n- remove references to option type 10 (it was never defined. It was proposed in a draft around 2002, but promptly removed)\n- update references for option 136 (RFC was published)\n- add options 138-142,145-147,149-150 (at least option names and maybe option parsing, if syntax not too complex)\n\nShould I cover those, too?",
